{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0174_1000_p", "source_sha256": "32d586cf323c8058136c9f5655102eeebfc26eba92acf3ba737ba2042394d84b", "ja": "（可憐達の野外ライブは、大盛況で終わった。さて、\nみんな打ち上げに行ったし、俺も急いで合流しないと）", "zh": "（可怜她们的户外演出在一片盛况中结束了。那么，\n大家都去参加庆功宴了，我也得赶紧和她们会合才行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0174_1001_045kar", "source_sha256": "fd9444178248f41c552b93b246677cb29096e1658a6a9ee538a365190c42a71a", "ja": "あ……お、お疲れさまです、\n{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "啊……辛、辛苦了，{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0174_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c4b8d9c31b3d31fc29316073e6664944d7ef708eca89e46bc467c62250622b54", "ja": "あれ？　可憐、打ち上げに行ったんじゃなかったのか。\nまだ着替えてもいないし……時間は大丈夫か？", "zh": "咦？可怜，你不是去参加庆功宴了吗？\n还没换衣服……时间来得及吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0174_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "87650923860e313a0840733a703957c37c8d1892a4d07b05bea7831664dbc242", "ja": "は、はい、まだ大丈夫です……。今日のライブのこと、\n振り返っておきたくて……もう少しだけ、ここに……。", "zh": "是、是的，还来得及……我想回顾一下今天的演出……所以想再在这里待一会儿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0174_1004_045kar", "source_sha256": "94e173f24600e5582243a30e2f474c5dfea34aaabbc5a56d08eb88ea374f516f", "ja": "今日のライブ、よくできたかもって……自分でも、\nちょっぴり思えて……それが、う、うれしくて……。", "zh": "今天的演出，或许完成得还不错……我自己也有一点点这么觉得……所、所以，很开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0174_1005_p", "source_sha256": "de2f869e4a655da828bb162e325550f3390bf4aa5dd25b41df20bed678e4d3c5", "ja": "ああ、すごく良かったよ。可憐と春香の\nパフォーマンスで、会場全体が揺れてたくらいだ！", "zh": "啊，表现得非常棒。可怜和春香的\n表演让整个会场都仿佛震动起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0174_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "d363052c13c82097c2d6be4a79624c1ad6bee03326dbd1149618d78eda7cac61", "ja": "ほ、本当ですか……？\nだとしたら、うれしいなぁ……てへへ♪", "zh": "真、真的吗……？\n如果是那样的话，我会很开心的……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0174_1007_045kar", "source_sha256": "d5a914cf3ca61f0de931c6cbd140dbdae5ad66967504279a8bfbc9380e8852c4", "ja": "今日は、とっても楽しかったです……また、春香さんと\n一緒に……ステージに立てたらいいな……なんて……。", "zh": "今天真的特别开心……要是以后还能和春香一起站上舞台……那就好了……嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0174_1008_p", "source_sha256": "1457b76ab81d266af35f5a7f341f3af04dc860c716c2d08fca107e07520dd765", "ja": "おお、いいじゃないか。\n春香に伝えたら、きっと喜ぶぞ！", "zh": "哦，不错嘛。\n告诉春香的话，她一定会很高兴的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0174_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "b52333e96961b591b1e0261966f21d9851ca422ec80940513d39ea8f5c9b737e", "ja": "ええっ！？　そ、そんな……わ、私なんかが\nそんなことを言ってしまって、いいんでしょうか……。", "zh": "诶！？怎、怎么会……我、我这样的人说出那种话，真的没关系吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0174_1010_p", "source_sha256": "df312be52d49503549fb38622d260c82f4df2b6088136c7c2414065cc35d9258", "ja": "もちろん、いいに決まってるよ。春香と可憐は\nとてもいいコンビだと思うしな。例えば……ほら。", "zh": "当然可以啊。春香和可怜可是很棒的搭档。我是这么觉得的。比如说……你看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0174_1011_045kar", "source_sha256": "3a513f18d5b51e16a08f26cc08ae666c40cc0f6fb32eaa20c4e78b5981c55c35", "ja": "あっ……これは、今日のライブの写真……？", "zh": "啊……这是今天演唱会的照片……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0174_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d20d2baf8b99f681c041b9fdf418b394c7c93d3921cfca1c5b285354d22cf061", "ja": "亜利沙が撮ったものを、俺のスマホに送ってきて\nくれたんだ。この写真を見て、可憐はどう思う？", "zh": "亚利沙把她拍的照片发到我的手机上了。看着这张照片，可怜觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0174_1013_045kar", "source_sha256": "1734ad55388044bfb2b1927d7b793829855a711bf53bcf78e894660d48d76b9a", "ja": "すごく、楽しそうです……春香さんも、私も……\nいい笑顔で、写ってます……。", "zh": "看起来特别开心……春香小姐和我……都笑得很灿烂……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0174_1014_045kar", "source_sha256": "8302846f3ffd416666f256da21dc18236a81e639f6318b9e4251d7716f3bb346", "ja": "なんだか、ふわふわして……あったかい……。", "zh": "总觉得，轻飘飘的……好温暖……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0174_1015_p", "source_sha256": "f1688e0cd8a5f3768c54dda006b0bf58c75d0c6d8858d0bc9232b491a8a0fd21", "ja": "そうだな。可憐と春香だからこそ、\n醸し出せる空気なんだと思う。", "zh": "是啊。我觉得，正因为是可怜和春香，才能营造出这样的氛围。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0174_1016_p", "source_sha256": "0bf3bcb3814a3f448627edfc9f8bcb2e84f713693b18e6a573c422a26791ef48", "ja": "きっと春香も、可憐と同じ気持ちなんじゃないかな。", "zh": "我想，春香一定也和可怜有着同样的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0174_1017_045kar", "source_sha256": "2f22ce2ee70ab9465294fedc69abd6f237a6268ec5942937d481adec0bacca25", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\nあ、ありがとうございます……！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n啊，谢谢您……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0174_1018_045kar", "source_sha256": "6d93826f162cfe9063336b28dd9003768116ccdda6b063a5018709ff076b25ca", "ja": "あ、あの、私……「またお願いします」って、\n春香さんに伝えてみます……！", "zh": "那、那个，我……会试着把“下次还请多多关照”转告给春香小姐……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0174_1019_p", "source_sha256": "de132c121c25f19513583d32f343b939e8050e84795cb361be8d2d564414e660", "ja": "それがいいな！　この画像は、可憐にも送ろうか。\n……ん？　他にも写真があるな。これは……？", "zh": "这样最好！要不要也把这张照片发给可怜？\n……嗯？还有其他照片啊。这是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0174_1020_045kar", "source_sha256": "06679dd55868d57a26d9ecf11048ffdb9acfd0e98b41b67c7bda7b325aeb7250", "ja": "ひゃあああっ！？\nこ、これは、お花見女子会の時の写真で……！", "zh": "呀啊啊啊！？  \n这、这是赏花女子会时拍的照片……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0174_1021_045kar", "source_sha256": "5033f832b908893f188cc67fd05dbb4eec2d85f407f924cb6c03f782bdb5e815", "ja": "ぜ、全部消したと思ったのに……うぅ……\nこの写真だけは、見ないでください～……！", "zh": "我、我明明以为全都删掉了……呜呜……\n只有这张照片，请不要看～……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0174_1022_p", "source_sha256": "0d91dc76e8b774859b129ccaa1f0e981cb53730129c7370efd390fd929725b4d", "ja": "あ、スマホを持っていかないでくれ！\n可憐！　可憐ー！", "zh": "啊，别把手机拿走啊！\n可怜！可怜——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
